OL,3,APolice investigating David Walliams
OL,4,Aover alleged serious sexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into David Walliams over
OL,8,F"alleged serious sexual offences".
OL,10,FIt comes after ITV News and the
OL,11,FGuardian published reports alleging
OL,12,Fthat Walliams had been accused of
OL,13,Fsexual misconduct by several women.
OL,15,FThe Met said that the allegations being
OL,16,Finvestigated are separate from those
OL,17,Freported by ITN and The Guardian, but
OL,18,Fas "part of their investigation,
OL,19,Fdetectives are also proactively
OL,20,Freviewing that reporting to establish
OL,21,Fwhether there is any evidence of
OL,22,Foffences".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
