OL,3,APolice investigating David Walliams
OL,4,Aover alleged serious sexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen those allegations were first
OL,7,Freported, Walliams said he was "not a
OL,8,Fsexual predator" and had not "broken
OL,9,Fthe law".
